From d12bada96ed65ad8ea69aabe65cc16db6ca7521c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sat, 6 Jun 2026 01:29:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 00702/11171] [outer-loop] Fix broken Pages/CI: untrack
 accidental nano-trm submodule gitlink

A conductor experiment (commit c4c612662, "Latent-Symbol Bridge Task 0") cloned
nano-trm into the working dir; the conductor's `git add -A` committed the embedded
repo as a submodule gitlink (mode 160000) with NO .gitmodules entry. Every GitHub
Actions checkout with submodules then failed at:
  fatal: No url found for submodule path 'nano-trm' in .gitmodules  (exit 128)
This broke the "pages build and deployment" workflow (so carnot-ebm.org froze on a
stale build and the new blog post 404'd), plus CI and phase1-reproducer, since
~2026-06-06 03:41Z.

Fix: `git rm --cached nano-trm` (keeps it on disk) + .gitignore the embedded
experiment clones (nano-trm, ebt_tmp, trm_src, hrm_ckpt) so a future `git add -A`
cannot re-commit them as gitlinks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitignore | 11 +++++++++++
 nano-trm   |  1 -
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 delete mode 160000 nano-trm

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 7d3dcc1262..d6b11dcc74 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -146,3 +146,14 @@ ops/.pretest-cache.json
 # Vendored EBT repo (has its own .git) — must NOT be committed as a submodule gitlink;
 # an orphaned ebt_tmp gitlink with no .gitmodules broke every GitHub Pages build (checkout step).
 ebt_tmp/
+
+# Embedded experiment clones (have their own .git) — must NEVER be committed as
+# submodule gitlinks. A conductor `git add -A` committed `nano-trm` as a mode
+# 160000 gitlink with no .gitmodules (commit c4c612662, 2026-06-06), which broke
+# EVERY GitHub Actions checkout (Pages, CI, phase1-reproducer) at
+# `fatal: No url found for submodule path 'nano-trm'`. Ignore the embedded repos
+# so this cannot recur.
+/nano-trm/
+/ebt_tmp/
+/trm_src/
+/hrm_ckpt/
diff --git a/nano-trm b/nano-trm
deleted file mode 160000
index fc4436c10d..0000000000
--- a/nano-trm
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1 +0,0 @@
-Subproject commit fc4436c10decebbaa6e3fe0d16b736630b2b5d3c
-- 
2.55.0

